  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 6.201,
      "end": 11.75,
      "duration": 5.549,
      "text": "PROFESSOR: So let's begin with trying to introduce you to"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 11.75,
      "end": 13.0,
      "duration": 1.25,
      "text": "biochemistry."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 15.87,
      "end": 21.9,
      "duration": 6.03,
      "text": "So I'm going to be thinking atoms and molecules for a"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 21.9,
      "end": 23.15,
      "duration": 1.25,
      "text": "little bit."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 29.76,
      "end": 32.64,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "text": "Let's begin by thinking about the composition of a cell, so"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 32.64,
      "end": 38.25,
      "duration": 5.61,
      "text": "that's the basic unit of life."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 38.25,
      "end": 47.86,
      "duration": 9.61,
      "text": "It's about 60% hydrogen, 20% oxygen, 12% carbon, 5%"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 47.86,
      "end": 52.07,
      "duration": 4.21,
      "text": "nitrogen, and then there's a bunch of other stuff--"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 52.07,
      "end": 58.741,
      "duration": 6.671,
      "text": "phosphates, sulfur, magnesium, manganese, et cetera."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 58.741,
      "end": 62.68,
      "duration": 3.939,
      "text": "But that's not very helpful way of studying biology."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 62.68,
      "end": 66.74,
      "duration": 4.06,
      "text": "It's interesting and is relevant in some contexts, but"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 66.74,
      "end": 69.96,
      "duration": 3.22,
      "text": "that's the atomic composition."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 69.96,
      "end": 74.12,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "text": "If we look instead at the molecular composition of a"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 74.12,
      "end": 78.61,
      "duration": 4.49,
      "text": "cell, then things start to get interesting."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 78.61,
      "end": 84.79,
      "duration": 6.18,
      "text": "Cells are about somewhere in the ballpark of 80% water."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 84.79,
      "end": 85.905,
      "duration": 1.115,
      "text": "Water's going to be very important--"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 85.905,
      "end": 87.87,
      "duration": 1.965,
      "text": "I'm going to be talking about that."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 87.87,
      "end": 101.74,
      "duration": 13.87,
      "text": "But of the remainder, then about 50% is protein, about"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 101.74,
      "end": 108.43,
      "duration": 6.69,
      "text": "15% are these molecules we call nucleic acids, and that"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 108.43,
      "end": 112.41,
      "duration": 3.98,
      "text": "means DNA and RNA, which most of you have probably heard of."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 112.41,
      "end": 115.15,
      "duration": 2.74,
      "text": "We'll be talking about those in great detail."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 115.15,
      "end": 118.0,
      "duration": 2.85,
      "text": "15% are carbohydrate--"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 118.0,
      "end": 121.95,
      "duration": 3.95,
      "text": "and in fact, we will talk about those today--"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 121.95,
      "end": 127.79,
      "duration": 5.84,
      "text": "and about 10% fall in the category of molecules known as"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 127.79,
      "end": 131.98,
      "duration": 4.19,
      "text": "lipids, which we'll be talking about in another day or two."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 131.98,
      "end": 134.85,
      "duration": 2.87,
      "text": "And then there's a bunch of other things-- vitamins and"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 134.85,
      "end": 138.61,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "text": "other things that happen, but you can sort of see the big"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 138.61,
      "end": 142.99,
      "duration": 4.38,
      "text": "classes of proteins that make up most of a cell are"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 142.99,
      "end": 146.74,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "text": "proteins, nucleic acids, carbohydrates, and lipids."
    }
  ],
